stock_move_line }o--o| stock_picking : picking_id
stock_move_line }o--o| stock_move : move_id
stock_move_line }o--o| product_product : product_id
stock_move_line }o--o| stock_lot : lot_id
stock_move_line }o--o| res_partner : owner_id
stock_move_line }o--|| stock_location : location_id, location_dest_id
stock_lot }o--|| product_product : product_id
stock_lot }o--o| stock_location : location_id
stock_quant }o--|| product_product : product_id
stock_quant }o--|| stock_location : location_id
stock_quant }o--o| stock_lot : lot_id
stock_quant }o--o| res_partner : owner_id
legend bottom
  * = no admite nulo · <<PK>> clave primaria · <<FK>> clave foránea · solo columnas clave
  Pata de gallo: ||  uno exacto · o|  cero o uno · }o  cero o muchos
